# DESK03/DESK04 run A -- select the C: icon, Remove desktop icon, Install devices.
#   Desktop icon grid at 640x480: g_icw = 91, g_ich = 46, DROOT origin y = 19.
#   C: icon cell (0,0) -> rect (0,19,76,40), centre (38,39).
#   Options title 160..232; drop-down entry n at y = 19 + n*16.
#     entry 3 = "Install devices"       -> 67..83,  centre 75
#     entry 4 = "Remove desktop icon"   -> 83..99,  centre 91
#   Park mid-right (600,240): the bottom-right corner now holds the Printer icon.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 38 39
1700 down
1703 up
1900 move 600 240
2300 mark B_SELECTED
2600 move 196 8
3000 move 200 91
3200 down
3203 up
3400 move 600 240
3900 mark C_REMOVED
4200 move 196 8
4600 move 200 75
4800 down
4803 up
5000 move 600 240
5600 mark D_REINSTALLED
